[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 6902.149, "timestamp": "01:55:02", "text": "它已经打开了，所以如果我按 T 键，他们应该能"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6905.75, "timestamp": "01:55:05", "text": "听到我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6911.189, "timestamp": "01:55:11", "text": "说话，对吧？理论上来说，是它会提示你说话还是你说话，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6913.35, "timestamp": "01:55:13", "text": "取决于你的设置"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6920.79, "timestamp": "01:55:20", "text": "好了，我们走吧。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6922.79, "timestamp": "01:55:22", "text": "现在，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6924.95, "timestamp": "01:55:24", "text": "当你扮演车兵时，大多数人都会对你很友好。 但当你像"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6927.91, "timestamp": "01:55:27", "text": "职业球员那样比赛时，通常"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6929.589, "timestamp": "01:55:29", "text": "不会有什么友谊可言。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6933.75, "timestamp": "01:55:33", "text": "但如果我扮演新兵，而他们却不配合，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6937.83, "timestamp": "01:55:37", "text": "我就无法正确履行我的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6940.79, "timestamp": "01:55:40", "text": "合同。 这就是问题所在。 是的，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6942.79, "timestamp": "01:55:42", "text": "但你可以四处搜寻，找到"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6949.75, "timestamp": "01:55:49", "text": "这取决于。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6952.31, "timestamp": "01:55:52", "text": "嗯，是的，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6955.75, "timestamp": "01:55:55", "text": "因为这是一个纯粹的PvP游戏，所以游戏里友好的人不多"}]